// combinatorics "co:" (characterization of trees, handshaking lemma, matrix tree theorem). Evolutionarily stable
// strategies and the replicator dynamics are theorems of game theory in ../../optimization/ ("opt:").
//
// Sources: as in data/concepts.js. Not checked by a specialist.
// Checked by ../../tests/check-theorems.js.

